.TH HD-ART 7 "October 2026" "hd-desktop" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-art \- the hyprdebian wallpapers
.SH DESCRIPTION
The package
.B hd-desktop
holds the wallpapers of hyprdebian, each rendered to PNG at four sizes:
.TP
.B emerald
The Emerald wallpaper of Debian 12, in its own colours; the theme
.I default
uses it.
.TP
.B softwaves-mulberry
The Soft Waves wallpaper of Debian 9, in the colours of the theme
.IR mulberry .
.TP
.B lines-sand
The Lines wallpaper of Debian 8, in the colours of the theme
.IR sand .
.PP
They are only the wallpapers; they have no commands and no settings.
.PP
The wallpapers are in
.IR /usr/share/backgrounds/hyprdebian :
.PP
.RS
.nf
<family>\-3840x2160.png    4K UHD, 16:9
<family>\-3440x1440.png    ultrawide, 21:9
<family>\-1920x1080.png    full HD, 16:9
<family>\-1024x768.png     4:3
.fi
.RE
.PP
The 3440x1440 wallpapers are rendered from the middle band of the
3840x2160 SVG.
The 1024x768 Lines wallpaper is rendered from its 1600x1200 SVG.
Soft Waves and Lines are recoloured with a gradient from the colour
.I dark
of the theme through
.I normal
to
.IR light ,
by the brightness of the original.
.SH USING THE WALLPAPERS
Pick the wallpaper that matches the resolution of the monitor, or the next
larger one.
To show it on the desktop with
.BR hyprpaper (1),
name it in
.IR ~/.config/hypr/hyprpaper.conf :
.PP
.RS
.nf
path = /usr/share/backgrounds/hyprdebian/emerald\-1920x1080.png
.fi
.RE
.SH COPYRIGHT
The wallpapers are PNG renders of the Emerald, Soft Waves and Lines theme
SVGs from the Debian package
.BR desktop-base ,
by Juliette Taka Belin, under the GPL, version 2 or later.
See
.IR /usr/share/doc/hd-desktop/copyright .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/backgrounds/hyprdebian/*.png
The wallpapers.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/hd-desktop/copyright
The copyright and license of the wallpapers.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hd-desktop (7),
